# SpeedLevel - Horde 1-60 zone plan (WoW Forever)
#
# The plan decides zone order, level windows, hubs and travel.  build_route.py fills
# each SEGMENT with every worthwhile Horde quest whose giver is on that map and whose
# level fits, orders them as a shortest tour and drops quests whose detour costs more
# than their XP is worth.
#
# Segment keywords:
#   races  Orc Troll Tauren Undead Skyborne   (default: all Horde)
#   map    <uiMapID>                            (Forever uiMap ids: Durotar 1411, Mulgore 1412, ...)
#   levels <minQuestLevel> <maxQuestLevel>      quest level window
#   entry  <level>                              override simulated entry level
#   endlevel <level>                            grind here until this level if behind
#   start  <x> <y> | npc <Name>                 where the tour starts
#   region x1 y1 x2 y2                          only quest givers inside this box
#   include / exclude / only <questIDs>
#   noauto                                      no automatic quests (travel-only segment)
#   prune <factor>                              travel/XP pruning strength (0 = off)
#   pre / post <STEP>                           manual steps before / after the quest tour
#   modes <speed dungeons thorough>             only build this segment in these modes
#   dungeon <areaIds>                           a dungeon run: its quests are done inside (dungeons mode)
#   entrance <map> <x> <y>                      instance portal (the arrow leads there)
#   runtime <minutes>                           time for the run incl. finding a group
#
# STEP kinds:
#   GOTO x y text            run somewhere
#   NOTE text                informational (click to continue)
#   HEARTH "Innkeeper Name"  set your hearthstone here
#   FP "Flight Master"       grab the flight path
#   FLY "Flight Master" Dest fly somewhere
#   USEHS text               use your hearthstone
#   BOAT x y text map=ID     take a boat / zeppelin (done when you arrive on map=ID)
#   TRAIN text               visit your class trainer
#   GRIND level text         grind mobs until level reached

# ===================================================================== ORC / TROLL
SEGMENT Valley of Trials
  races Orc Troll
  map 1411
  levels 1 7
  entry 1
  start npc Kaltunk
  region 33 55 53 82

SEGMENT Durotar
  races Orc Troll
  map 1411
  levels 3 12
  start 47 60
  pre GOTO 51.9 43.5 "Run to Razor Hill"
  pre HEARTH "Innkeeper Grosk"
  post TRAIN "Train new spells (Razor Hill or Orgrimmar)"

SEGMENT Orgrimmar
  races Orc Troll
  map 1454
  levels 8 14
  start npc Doras
  pre GOTO 45.5 12.0 "Run north into Orgrimmar" map=1411
  pre FP "Doras"
  post TRAIN "Train new spells in Orgrimmar"
  post GOTO 34.3 42.2 "Leave Orgrimmar through the west gate and follow the road to the Crossroads" map=1411

