# ===================================================================== CLASS CHAINS
# Quests that unlock abilities / pets.  Each becomes its own section, shown only to that class.
# `finals` = the last quest(s) of the chain: prerequisites and per-race/city alternatives are pulled in
# automatically from QuestieDB.  `after` = the section it follows in the route.

